WEBVTT

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:10.420 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Yasashii hidamari ni CHAIMU ga DIREI suru

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:10.420 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
Under the gentle sunlight, the chimes seem to pause.

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:18.220 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Hoho wo naderu kaze ibuki wa fukaku natteku

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:18.220 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
I breathe deeper as the wind brushes my cheeks.

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:23.380 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Toomawari no namida namaetsuketa ashita

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:23.380 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
Those indirect tears, the tomorrow we named,

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:27.560 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Kasanaru mirai iro no RAIN

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:27.560 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
And the criss-crossing lines stained future…

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:32.270 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Adokenai konna kimochi mo

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:32.270 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
Let these innocent feelings

00:00:32.270 --> 00:00:36.550 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Hajiketobu hodo waraiaeta hi mo

00:00:32.270 --> 00:00:36.550 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
And our days of laughter

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:43.630 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Taisetsu ni sodatete ikeru you ni

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:43.630 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
Become all the more precious to us.

00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:47.530 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Togire togire no toki wo koete

00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:47.530 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
You showed me many new things,

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:51.690 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Takusan no hajimete wo kureta

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:51.690 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
Crossing the fragmented moments.

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:57.540 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Tsunagatte yuke todoke

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:57.540 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
I want my feelings to join yours… to reach you…

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:03.620 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I've heard she's quite the terror.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:06.000 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
If you stare into her eyes for more than three
seconds...

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.120 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I've heard of her.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.790 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Misfortunes come to haunt you in seven days, right?

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:11.090 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
That's the rumor.

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:13.710 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
How terrifying!

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:18.470 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Oh, and I heard that Yuka stared into her eyes and
went down with a cold.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:21.220 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
She has to be real!

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:22.720 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Umm...

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:27.310 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
You dropped this...

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:29.230 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm sorry!!!

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:31.150 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
You can keep it!!!

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:36.990 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
For some reason, I always find people apologizing to
me.

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:41.780 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I hear she can sense ghosts and even summon them.

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:45.290 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
And her name is also Sadako, like from The Ring.

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:48.370 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
You have to give it to her parents for
giving her such an appropriate name.

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:57.930 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Feel free to use this stall. It's open now.

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:06.020 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm sorry for not living up to your
expectations, but I can't see ghosts...

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:10.230 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
And my name is Sawako, not Sadako.

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:14.030 line:18.5% position:37.8% size:22% align:center
S

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:14.030 line:25.5% position:37.8% size:22% align:center
a

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:14.030 line:32.4% position:37.8% size:22% align:center
w

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:14.030 line:39.4% position:37.8% size:22% align:center
a

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:14.030 line:48.1% position:37.8% size:22% align:center
k

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:14.030 line:55.1% position:37.8% size:22% align:center
o

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:14.030 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
My name means "Lively Child".

00:02:14.030 --> 00:02:19.030 line:70.4% position:50% size:22% align:center
prologue

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:26.120 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
For some reason, people are always afraid of me.

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:29.750 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I just want to be friendly.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.880 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'll really try my best today.

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:37.670 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I heard that a lot of celebrities show up there.

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:40.010 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Hirano-san... Endou-san...

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:39.220 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Seriously?

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:40.380 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
That's what I heard!

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:41.890 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Good morning...

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:45.890 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I think I was able to greet them cheerfully.

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:48.480 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Morning!

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:50.310 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Oh, you walking to school?

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:52.310 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
It's Kazehaya-kun!

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:55.320 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Amazing...

00:02:55.820 --> 00:03:00.450 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
He's always at the center of attention,
not to mention how cheerful and lively he is.

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:02.450 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Morning, Kuronuma.

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:05.660 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
What a kind soul!

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:09.830 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I can't believe he'd greet me the same way he does
others!

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:11.170 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
G-Good m-

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:12.920 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Yo, Ryu.

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:13.710 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Hey.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:16.210 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
PLACEHOLDER

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.250 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Did you do your homework, Kazehaya?

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:19.170 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Kazehaya-kun is the complete opposite of me.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:18.300 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Of course not.

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:19.630 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Figures.

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:19.880 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
PLACEHOLDER

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:21.340 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
We're in the same boat.

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:22.970 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Everyone gathers around Kazehaya-kun,

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:25.220 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
and it's almost as if people form a circle around
him.

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:28.850 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
The day of our high school entrance ceremony...

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:39.650 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
U-Umm...

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:45.950 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
If you're looking for Kitahoro High, it's that way.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.330 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Thanks!

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:59.380 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
People are always apologizing to
me, but he smiled and said "Thanks".

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:06.350 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Since that day, I've aspired to be like
Kazehaya-kun.

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:11.850 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I hope that someday, I'll be able to act like him.

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:17.940 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
And so, we're going to hold an event to test our
courage on the day before the closing ceremony.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:20.280 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
You going?

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:26.490 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm going to put up this sign-up sheet on the
board, so be sure to sign up if you want to attend.

