Organizer
Kazehaya

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:28.160 line:60.2% position:60.7% size:22% align:center
Test of Courage

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:28.160 line:68.5% position:78.9% size:22% align:center
Participants
200 Yen Fee

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:28.160 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
It'd be great if everyone could make it.

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:31.870 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
"Everyone"? That means...

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:33.910 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I wonder if Sadako's coming, too.

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:35.830 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I bet if she shows up, real ghosts would come along
with her.

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:39.710 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I-I can't live up to their expectations!

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:43.720 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I wonder if people would be
disappointed if I went, but no ghosts appeared...

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:47.640 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Well, you'll all be in summer
vacation once the closing ceremony ends.

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:50.560 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Which means... summer classes.

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:52.140 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
What?!

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:57.560 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I need a volunteer who'd be willing to take some
time
off from their summer to help me prepare for the
classes.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.150 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
It won't be very long.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:01.690 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
If no one wants to volunteer, I'll just pick
someone.

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:06.070 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
N-No one wants to do it...

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:08.200 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Umm...

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:11.700 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
If it's okay with you, I wouldn't mind doing it...

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:13.410 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Oh, really?

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:14.910 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Then I'll put your name down, Kuronuma.

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:16.000 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Teach!

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:21.050 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Kuronuma's always getting stuck with jobs like that.

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:24.550 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
No way...

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:31.890 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I don't think it's right to give her
all the jobs people don't want to do.

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:34.600 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Then would you like to take her place, Kazehaya?

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:35.770 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Huh?

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:38.850 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
No choice.

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:39.900 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I guess I'll do it.

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:42.570 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
He noticed?

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:45.110 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
That I've always been working?

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:52.450 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Umm...

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:55.200 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Please, let me do it.

00:05:55.660 --> 00:06:00.210 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I don't really have anything
planned for the summer, so I'll be bored.

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:01.090 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Very bored.

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:04.050 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I live close by, and I'll be really bored.

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:05.590 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Well, if you insist...

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:07.340 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
PLACEHOLDER

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:08.430 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
That was close, Kazehaya.

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:09.010 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I can't believe he noticed...

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:12.890 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Even things that were being done by a quiet girl
like me...

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:17.230 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
What a nice person!

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:19.350 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
That really made my day...

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:21.940 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Sadako!

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:23.900 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Shino-chan!

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:25.690 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
It's been a while!

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:28.320 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Yeah, we're in different classes after all.

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:30.070 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
How are you getting along with your classmates?

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:32.200 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
There's no one from your old schools, right?

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:34.120 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Yeah. But...

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:36.950 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Well... There's someone called Kazehaya-kun, and...

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:38.960 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Oh, that lively one?

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:40.880 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
"Lively" is an understatement!

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:44.090 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'd say one hundred percent liveliness.

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:49.300 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
No, it's actually more like he's made out of
liveliness itself!

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:56.220 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Kazehaya-kun!

00:06:57.890 --> 00:07:00.850 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
This is bad! He totally heard that!

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:01.940 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
You should apologize.

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:04.320 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Apologize?

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:06.190 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
What?!

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:08.780 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I was complimenting him, but I guess they
misunderstood me?!

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:11.280 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Hey, what you said...

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:14.280 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
How should I interpret that?

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:20.580 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
As...

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:22.250 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
As a compliment!

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:23.210 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Huh?!

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:28.800 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Roger.

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:33.010 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'll be over there in a second, so wait there.

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:36.720 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
We've never really had a chance to talk.

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:41.230 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Aren't you happy, Sadako?

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:45.060 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I heard that Kazehaya-kun can't stand it when a
student can't fit in with the rest of the class.

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:47.110 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I can rest easy now.

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:48.030 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
See ya!

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:54.070 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
What an... What an amazing person Kazehaya-kun is!

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:58.080 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
He believed me when I told him what I really meant.

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:01.540 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
He took my word for what it was!

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:07.670 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm so glad!

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:11.380 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I always thought you didn't like me.

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:12.800 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
D-Dislike?!

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:15.260 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
N-No, you have it all wrong!

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:20.310 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I've always dreamed of being lively like you!

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:21.850 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Always...

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:27.400 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
But seriously, I'm not as lively as you think I am.

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:28.400 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
No way!

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:29.780 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
You really are.

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:31.690 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Even your name.

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:34.150 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Speak for yourself.

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:36.410 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
"Sawako".

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:41.080 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Your name is Kuronuma Sawako, right?

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:48.290 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
No one... ever calls me that...

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:54.340 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
This... may be the first time that I've
been able to clear up a misunderstanding.

00:08:56.390 --> 00:08:59.890 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
But you were able to speak your mind when you tried.

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:05.310 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
He's... amazing...

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:10.190 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Amazing... this is the first time someone from
school has called me by my name...

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:12.480 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
And the first time anyone's made me feel this way...

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:15.280 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
You'd better come to that event, okay?

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:17.700 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
The first time in my life...

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:27.670 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I guess I'll go put my name in secret...

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:30.460 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Huh? Sadako?

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:31.550 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Yeah!

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:35.090 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I bet the event will be so much
better if someone were to play a ghost.

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:40.010 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm sure Sadako will be able to
scare people off just by standing there!

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:42.810 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Umm...

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:45.730 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
H-H-How long have you been standing there?

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:47.810 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Umm... I was wondering...

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:50.360 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Could you let me be the ghost?

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:51.690 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Huh?

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:55.990 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
You don't need to force yourself.

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:57.700 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
We'd feel kind of bad if you didn't actually want to
do it.

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:04.450 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
But you were able to speak your mind when you tried.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:11.130 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I've... never done anything I didn't want to do.

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:18.340 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I've always just wanted to get along with everyone,
but I
haven't been doing those chores because I didn't
want to do them.

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:22.600 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
It's just that it makes me happy if I could be of
some use...

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:30.270 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Also, I'm sorry I can't live up to everyone's
expectations, but...

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:31.190 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
What is it?

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:33.110 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I can't summon ghosts.

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:34.110 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
What?

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:36.360 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I can't sense ghosts or anything.

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:38.360 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
You can't?

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:39.200 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
No.

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:40.530 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Not at all?

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:41.490 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Nope.

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.290 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
And it took you this long to admit that?!

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:51.920 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
And what do you mean, "expectations"?! You're such
an odd one!

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:53.920 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Seriously, that's so weird!

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:55.090 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Don't you agree, Chizu?

00:10:56.090 --> 00:10:58.010 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Why are you crying?

00:10:58.010 --> 00:11:02.340 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm a sucker for brave girls like her...

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:04.930 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
You're weird, too...

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:07.470 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
We're counting on you to put on
the best ghost act of all time, Sadako!

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:12.560 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'll keep this a secret between the
three of us, so go scare them as you please!

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:15.980 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Thank you so much!

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:21.200 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I was able to get through to them...

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:24.990 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Even if it was just a little bit, I feel like I was
able to change.

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:27.410 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Kazehaya-kun...

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:34.000 line:64.8% position:50% size:22% align:center
Kuronuma Sawako

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:31.830 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
This is all thanks to you.

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:37.800 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Every ten minutes, a new pair will head out!

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:40.220 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Looks like almost everyone is here.

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:42.050 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I guess Sadako is the only one who didn't show up.

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:43.510 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Oh, Sadako is actually-

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:46.050 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Didn't I say it was a secret?

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:01.280 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I want everyone to have a great time!

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:02.150 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'll do my best!

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:05.030 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
It's so dark...

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:06.580 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm actually starting to get scared...

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:29.260 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
A ghost!!!

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:33.560 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I think they liked it!

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:41.440 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
W-What are those screams?

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:43.240 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
What's going on?

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:47.160 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Good job.

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:48.870 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm so happy...

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:51.580 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm actually being useful to everyone!

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:55.210 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Maybe I'll hold a lock of my hair in my mouth next
time.

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:06.840 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Kuronuma?!

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:08.390 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Kazehaya-kun!

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:10.350 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
W-What are you doing here?!

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:13.980 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
P-Playing a ghost for a bit...

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:15.440 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
What the heck...

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:17.440 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
You should've told me.

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:20.480 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm the coordinator for the time being, after all.

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:22.820 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I thought you weren't coming.

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:29.530 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I didn't want to make you look less cool...

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:30.490 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Huh?

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:32.200 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
What are you talking about?

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:35.910 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Aren't you scared being out here all by yourself?

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:38.920 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I enjoy the nighttime.

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:41.960 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Especially summer nights.

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:45.220 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
The air... the scent...

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:50.140 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
The sound of the wind rustling through the leaves...
the insects...

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:55.060 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
You're right.

00:13:57.310 --> 00:14:00.560 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
It feels pretty good out here. Can I stay here with
you?

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:01.610 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Huh?

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:04.030 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
But... what about the event?

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:09.910 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Because a certain someone didn't show up,
there was an odd number of people, and I had to go
alone.

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:11.330 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
*no flashlights* *SUCKS TO BE YOU!* *go out there
alone!!*

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:11.330 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
*threesomes aren't allowed* *no tagging along with
another group*

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:11.330 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
It's scary out here alone.

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:19.330 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
What's happening right now?

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.340 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Sadako!

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.920 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Yano-san! Yoshida-san!

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:27.550 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Huh? What's Kazehaya doing here?

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:30.590 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
If you guys knew about this, you should've told me.

00:14:30.590 --> 00:14:33.850 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Oh my, aren't you a gentleman?

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:36.180 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Lively guys are so amazing!

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:38.390 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Cut it out already!

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:39.640 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Sadako.

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:42.900 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Looks like you've been doing a great job.

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:44.230 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Here, drink up.

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:48.700 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Thank you!

