00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:57.290 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Looks like you're beginning to open up to others.

00:14:58.460 --> 00:14:59.410 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm glad to hear it.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.630 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Opening up?

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:03.630 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Really?

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:09.010 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I-It's all thanks to you, Kazehaya-kun!

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:12.050 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I haven't done a thing.

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:17.470 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
No, I wouldn't have been able to
express my feelings if it weren't for you.

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:21.190 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm so glad I took this job.

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:25.320 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
You're actually pretty cheerful, don't you think?

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:27.980 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
You're really optimistic!

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:30.950 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Cheerful? Me?

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:35.330 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
That's the first time anyone's ever said that to me.

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:39.500 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Don't stare at me for so long!

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:42.290 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I-I-I-I'm so sorry!

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:44.040 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I got too carried away...

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:48.000 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'll try not to stare into your eyes for more than
three seconds!

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:51.760 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
But the thing is, it really won't cause misfortune
or anything-

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:51.760 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
That's not what I mean!

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:53.680 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
It's embarrassing...

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:55.800 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Don't make me say it, geez...

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:07.520 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
He suddenly stopped talking, so I don't really know
what to do...

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:10.740 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
It feels like my heart is a complete mess...

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:13.860 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
It's like I was reborn.

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:16.120 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
So many new feelings that I've never experienced
before...

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:21.790 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
It seems like Kazehaya-kun is introducing me to many
new things...

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:26.000 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm... so glad I was able to meet him.

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:28.300 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
It's over!

00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:29.630 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Summer break!

