00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:36.550 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
First of all, Kazehaya, you're getting a penalty.

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:38.310 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
You didn't even finish!

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:40.470 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
You guys noticed?

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:41.640 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Tanaka, you came in first.

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:43.850 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Your prize are sixty scrubbing brushes.

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:45.150 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
What kind of a prize is that?!

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:50.110 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
And Kazehaya, your penalty for not finishing is...

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:54.820 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
...you get to date Sadako-chan for a week!

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:57.570 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
W-What did he just say?!

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:03.000 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I heard you were with Sadako last night, Kazehaya.

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:05.290 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I bet she was making a move on you.

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:06.750 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
You guys should totally hook up.

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:09.920 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
You guys just crossed the line.

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:12.510 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm willing to do anything but that.

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:15.380 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Hey, now...

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:19.140 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
That's awfully rude as a penalty.

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:21.770 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Kuronuma's a girl, you know.

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:23.020 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
This isn't even funny as a joke.

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:26.770 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Don't let this get to you, Kuronuma.

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:29.770 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
No...

00:17:30.770 --> 00:17:32.530 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
You can't stand up for me...

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:37.160 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Kazehaya-kun... your reputation will be...

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:39.160 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
It's a misunderstanding!

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:45.120 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
As you all say, I was indeed with Kazehaya-kun last
night.

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:47.420 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
But that's not...

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:51.130 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
...anything special like you all are thinking.

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:57.130 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
It was only because Kazehaya-kun is willing to talk
to anybody.

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:59.260 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
It's fine.

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:03.310 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I know how to clear up a misunderstanding now.

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:10.810 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
But it's true I was attracted to
Kazehaya-kun's kindness, liveliness, cheerfulness...

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:14.570 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
...and integrity.

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:19.490 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
That's... how it is.

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:27.410 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
P-Please excuse me.

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:34.460 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I did the right thing.

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:39.300 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm sure the misunderstanding was cleared up.

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:42.430 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I didn't tell a single lie.

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:45.310 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I only told the truth.

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:48.440 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I'm sure I was able to protect Kazehaya-kun's
reputation.

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:54.520 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
What? Even though it's summer vacation?

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:57.610 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Yeah. I need to help out my teacher.

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:00.490 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
That's right.

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:02.160 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I...

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:05.450 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I know I did the right thing.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:12.500 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
But...

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:14.590 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Even so, I'm lonely.

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:20.180 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I may never be able to look him in the eye after we
get back from summer vacation.

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:24.350 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
He may never smile and say, "Good morning," to me
again.

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:26.890 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
He may start to avoid me...

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:30.230 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I thought I was used to all these things by now, and
yet...

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:36.360 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
The last few days of my life have
been so wonderful; I forgot all about it.

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:42.320 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
About the way I was before I met Kazehaya-kun.

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:47.450 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I've already forgotten...

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:51.370 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Why...

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:54.420 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
It's summer break already...

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:57.210 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
They said you were the shadow MVP.

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:01.220 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Sorry Sadako! Forgive us!
--Your Classmates

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:01.220 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Everyone apologized.

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:07.220 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
The misunderstanding was cleared up, right?

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:13.060 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
You stood up for me, and then you
came all this way to give this to me...

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:14.810 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
And you're still willing to talk to me...

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:16.650 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I really appreciate it...

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:17.610 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Hey...

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:22.990 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I have a feeling you don't really understand me.

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:24.990 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Don't worry about me!

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:27.950 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I understand how you feel, Kazehaya-kun!

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:28.910 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
No, you don't!

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:36.840 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Is it all right if I expect...

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:40.210 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
...that we'll see each other over the summer, too?

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:44.970 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Back then...

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:47.850 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
U-Umm...

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:53.140 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
If you're looking for Kitahoro High, it's that way.

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:55.190 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
Thanks!

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:03.990 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
That feeling I felt back then...

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:08.490 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
This feeling, which has since then continued to
grow...

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:13.710 line:83.4% position:50% size:90% align:center
I wonder if it'll reach you someday.

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:25.970 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Sono sora ippai no kamihikouki gurai ni natte

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:25.970 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
I want to become one of those paper airplanes
filling the sky.

00:21:29.820 --> 00:21:36.430 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Wakaranai sore ga kotae nan datte

00:21:29.820 --> 00:21:36.430 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
"I don't understand." That is your answer?

00:21:36.430 --> 00:21:40.120 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
SHABON tama tobosou

00:21:36.430 --> 00:21:40.120 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
Let's blow a bubble

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:48.320 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Sora made wa kitto todokanai uchi ni kowarechau

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:48.320 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
Though it'll likely burst before reaching the sky.

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:53.690 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Ima tada shiritai no eien ja nai

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:53.690 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
I just want to know. This moment won't last forever,

00:21:53.690 --> 00:22:01.580 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Kono mama zutto mite itai kedo

00:21:53.690 --> 00:22:01.580 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
Though I want to keep watching you till the end of
time.

00:22:01.580 --> 00:22:12.790 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Sono sora ippai no kamihikouki gurai ni natte

00:22:01.580 --> 00:22:12.790 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
I want to become one of those paper airplanes
filling the sky.

00:22:14.950 --> 00:22:20.980 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Hitotsu dake mitsukete

00:22:14.950 --> 00:22:20.980 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
So you can find the right one.

